</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Trials must and will befall;</l><l>But with humble faith to see</l><l>Love inscribed upon them all—</l><l>This is happiness to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Did I meet no trials here,</l><l>No chastisement by the way,</l><l>Might I not with reason fear</l><l>I should prove a castaway?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Trials make the promise sweet;</l><l>Trials give new life to prayer;</l><l>Bring me to my Savior’s feet,</l><l>Lay me low and keep me there.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
